config APP_SPORT
    bool "Sport activity apps (Run, Bike)"
    help
      Garmin-style Run and Bike apps on the watch's own sensors: GNSS
      through the location service (CONFIG_SERVICE_LOCATION) when the
      board has it, heart rate, barometer and steps.
